a) make rtp file with 83 ECM/49 regr profiles, randomly changed scanang and spres
b) run KCARTA to make jacs
c) run SARTA to make SARTA jacs
d) put together SARTA and KCARTA jacs
e) use NN to turn sarta jacs into kcarta jacs

