PRELIMINARY

Use
  /home/sergio/git/matlabcode/REGR_PROFILES_SARTA/REGR49_PROFILES_for_kCARTA_breakouts_for_SARTA/regr49_1013.op.rtp
with KCARTA
  /home/sergio/git/kcarta_gen/WORK/RUN_TARA/GENERIC_RADSnJACS_MANYPROFILES/set_rtp.m
to make WV,T,O3,CO2,CH4 jacs at t = 2002 (370 ppm), 2012 (392 ppm), 2022 (412 ppm)

Then also use SARTA to do the same jacs.

Compare and see how to "fix" the sarta jacs

a) driver_make_rtpfile.m
   puts together 83 ECM profiles and 49 REGR profiles
   then randomizes scanang/spres .. using skewed distributon for spres
   add in d/dt for CO2/CH4/N2O/T/WV for 5 steps (5 years apart 2002:5.5:2022)

b) KCARTA jacs dome in /home/sergio/git/kcarta_gen/WORK/RUN_TARA/GENERIC_RADSnJACS_MANYPROFILES/ and copied to
   DATA/v1/KCARTA/

c) sarta jacs : see clustmake_sartajacs.m, writes out to
   DATA/v1/SARTA
   
d) put together sarta and kcarta jacs
     loop_driver_compare_sarta_kcarta_jacs.m    calls    driver_compare_sarta_kcarta_jacs.m
   writes out to
   DATA/v1/COMBINED
   %% this makes DATA/v1/COMBINED/sarta_kcarta_1.mat ... DATA/v1/COMBINED/sarta_kcarta_660.mat

